      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Gathering the cooks in the kitchen, Lyova announces that Viktor Petrovich will be away recovering for another two weeks. As Senya jokes about the boss slacking off to drink beer, Chef Barinov himself steps out from hiding and scolds the laughing crew.",
